      "grouping_at_time": "Powerplant",
      "title_at_revision": "Ventilation [and drainage.]",
      "text": "[ Each compartment containing any part of the powerplant installation must have provision for ventilation and drainage of flammable fluids. The drainage means must be--\n(a) Effective under conditions expected to prevail when drainage is needed, and\n(b) Arranged so that no discharged fluid will cause an additional fire hazard.]",
